Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:15:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: iommu: keep the certified ANS kexec handoff

Resetting the ANS host or its translations destroys the state required
by the next kernel. Describe the board-selected retained handoff.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/apple,dart.yaml | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/apple,dart.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/apple,dart.yaml
index df72722fc..adcbd21fc 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/apple,dart.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/apple,dart.yaml
@@ -21,6 +21,10 @@ description: |+
   fault conditions.
 
 properties:
+  apple,ans-dart-handoff:
+    type: boolean
+    description: Allow the storage endpoint to retire and rebuild this DART stream during kexec.
+
   compatible:
     oneOf:
       - enum:
